 for payment.","t":{"ru":"нанимать, нанять","nl":"aanwerven, aanstellen, aannemen","pl":"zatrudniać, zatrudnić, najmować","de":"einstellen, anstellen, anwerben","fr":"embaucher, recruter, engager","it":"assumere, ingaggiare, impiegare","cs":"najmout, zaměstnat, přijmout","tr":"işe almak, istihdam etmek","es":"contratar, emplear"}},{"w":"intern","d":"A student or recent graduate who works in a company or organization to gain professional experience, often without pay.","t":{"ru":"стажёр, практикант","nl":"stagiair, praktikant","pl":"stażysta, stażystka, praktykant","de":"Praktikant, Praktikantin","fr":"stagiaire","it":"stagista, tirocinante, praticante","cs":"stážista, stážistka, praktikant","tr":"stajyer, stajyer öğrenci","es":"becario, pasante, practicante"}},{"w":"interview","d":"A formal meeting where someone is asked questions to determine if they are suitable for a job or course.","t":{"ru":"собесе́дование, интервью́","nl":"sollicitatiegesprek, interview","pl":"rozmowa kwalifikacyjna, rozmowa o pracę, interview","de":"Vorstellungsgespräch, Bewerbungsgespräch, Einstellungsgespräch","fr":"entretien d'embauche, entretien","it":"colloquio, colloquio di lavoro","cs":"přijímací pohovor, pracovní pohovor, pohovor","tr":"mülakat, iş görüşmesi","es":"entrevista, entrevista de trabajo"}},{"w":"job","d":"A regular activity performed in exchange for payment, especially as one's trade, occupation, or profession.","t":{"ru":"рабо́та, до́лжность, ме́сто","nl":"baan, werk, job","pl":"praca, posada, zajęcie","de":"Arbeit, Job, Beruf","fr":"travail, emploi, job","it":"lavoro, impiego, mestiere","cs":"práce, zaměstnání, místo","tr":"iş, meslek, görev","es":"trabajo, empleo, chamba"}},{"w":"manager","d":"A person whose job is to manage something, such as a business, a restaurant, or a sports team.","t":{"ru":"менеджер, управляющий, директор","nl":"manager, bedrijfsleider, directeur","pl":"menedżer, kierownik, menadżer","de":"Manager, Geschäftsführer, Leiter","fr":"directeur, géran